  "summary": "<p>Today, President Donald J. Trump travels to Grand Island, Nebraska. Under President Trump and Republican leadership, families in the Cornhusker State are keeping more of what they earn, farmers and ranchers are getting direct support, private investment is expanding production, and crime is falling in the state’s largest cities. Historic Tax Relief for Nebraskans President [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/president-trump-and-republicans-are-delivering-real-results-for-nebraska/\">President Trump and Republicans Are Delivering Real Results for Nebraska</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
